{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在上半屏左侧的大号白色文字块，字号最大、明暗对比最强；右上角蓝色小标题和下方金色音符动画是次要视觉信息。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他想起从前曾被人当作自己人，短暂高兴后又心酸；具体眼下处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂高兴、心酸。\",\n  \"missed\": \"离开后才发现心里空了；旧日生活无法重来，对离开后是否会更好也没有把握；情绪从焦躁转为柔和，以及轻松感并没有真正解决问题。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块文字过长，一块里包含回忆、短暂高兴、心酸、对未来的疑问等多层意思。\",\n    \"核心处境和情绪关系需要顺着长段文字继续读才能完整理解。\",\n    \"右上角的小标题虽然概括了离开后的空虚感，但字号明显较小，容易被大段白字压过。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dd33bfad-284e-486f-9ede-4be8fc230ea7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T020211238393Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.563, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:02:32.801282+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6d13ff5147300113d27a5fbdc2fbb761741da7a187d9666e92e9e6e7b7e8325f", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool